{
  "$comment": "Production concerns the MNDX router checks every task against. `triggers` are hints for the deterministic first pass (`mndx.js route`); Claude's judgment adds or drops concerns from there. `implies` pulls in related concerns (accounts mean personal data, so privacy). `always` concerns apply to every item (`ui` ones to any item with a user interface). `checklist` is an MNDX file in skills/concerns/. `skills` are community skills from config/skills.json (or Claude Code built-ins listed in `builtinSkills`).",
